            "notes": "Taking triple threat power gives you a massive damage increase at close range. It will allow you to delete enemy players instantly if you TP on top of them. It works well with Asa's armaments since the extra daggers also bounce. You might want to get an ammo item as triple threat increases ammo consumption. \n\nWe now can afford goddess's aura. This important item allows you to attack players at close range and survive. Every 5-6 seconds, you TP to a better position or attack an enemy, and this item gives you 100 overhealth. You can deal damage up close and survive the encounter, causing total chaos in the enemy team's backline.\n\nIf the rounds are taking longer than usual (ex: brawl team fighting on point), take vanadium injection item instead. When your ult is ready, vanadium gives 100 HP like goddess's aura and some nice bonus stats too.",
